/E (Managing e-commerce information manually can lead to data duplication, errors, and difficulties in tracking orders and payments. The objective of this project is to develop a structured database that stores and manages customer information, products, orders, and payments efficiently. The system should support product management, order processing, payment tracking, sales reports, identification of best-selling products, and customer purchase history.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
